Z||000006||Jay||05-06-2001||11:26 AM||||You'd  have to use the Fiero bumper and the NSX bumper together.  By cutting and fitting the NSX bumper to the Fiero bumper you will ensure that it fits to the stock mounting points. It is time consuming but anyone with some fibreglass experience should be able to help. Once you have one made up that fits the fiero front end, then you can get a mold made. Any fibreglass guy could make a mold for you. Hope this helps.<P>I was looking at the Ferrari 355 nose for the Fiero.  Seen a few  with it done and it looks great.  Easier too, since the kit is already made for the Fiero.<P>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT <A HREF="http://www.members.home.net/jaygrande" TARGET=_blank>www.members.home.net/jaygrande</A> ||||reg||1
